B('framing-change-aversion', 'Change aversion', 'A. Sedley & H. Müller (Google)', 2013, 'Users react negatively to changes initially, regardless of quality, then adapt.', 'Expect short-term dips after redesigns; give advance notice, opt-in periods and explanations.', 'Do major changes come with notice, explanation and transition support?')
write('curated_biases', R)
